    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36821" root="كرب" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرْبَانُ</span></b>  A vessel <i>nearly full:</i> (S:) fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرْبَاءُ</span>;
pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرْبَى</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كِرَابٌ</span>. (TA.) Yaakoob asserts,
that the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ك</span> in this word is a substitute for the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ق</span>
in <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرْبَانُ</span>; but ISd denies this. (TA.)

